---
---

<section class="ritual grain" id="ritual">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="secnum" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
      <p class="lab">Ritual de uso</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="display" data-reveal>Un día, <em>tres momentos.</em></h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <article data-reveal>
        <p class="hora">06:00 — Mañana</p>
        <div class="foto">
          <img
            src="/images/mind-product.jpg"
            alt="Ritual matutino Mind"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="display">Activa</h3>
        <p>MIND Enfoque con tu primera bebida del día. La primera hora manda.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <p class="hora">13:00 — Tarde</p>
        <div class="foto">
          <img
            src="/images/ref-10.jpg"
            alt="Ritual de media tarde"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="display">Ejecuta</h3>
        <p>MIND Energía antes de entrenar o de la sesión profunda. Sin cafeína nerviosa.</p>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <p class="hora">22:00 — Noche</p>
        <div class="foto">
          <img
            src="/images/disolucion.jpg"
            alt="Ritual nocturno Gnosis"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <h3 class="display">Desciende</h3>
        <p>GNOSIS Nocturna para cerrar pantallas, bajar el ritmo y entrar a la noche.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="ritual-cta" data-reveal>
      <a href="#productos" class="btn btn-ember">Encontrar mi ritual</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ritual {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--void);
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sec-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h2 em {
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  .timeline {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 26px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ember) 50%, transparent);
  }
  article {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .hora {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ember);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    background: var(--void);
    display: inline-block;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }
  .foto {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .foto img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 300px;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 500ms ease-out;
  }
  article:nth-child(1) .foto img {
    object-position: center 40%;
  }
  article:nth-child(2) .foto img {
    object-position: center 65%;
  }
  article:hover .foto img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  article p:last-child {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ritual-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: flex;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .timeline {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .timeline::before {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
